df00bc/ss_2347f138c96df53de1bf46318ad4ff36a4df00bc.600x338.jpg?t=1757328482"}],"short_description":"A combat-focused spaceship building game. Explore a galaxy full of surprises. Gather resources and blueprints. Upgrade your ship. Defeat the boss and collect the bounty. Create your own space opera in the sandbox!","steam_appid":2876200,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://exospace-combat-engineer.com/support/"},"supported_languages":"English, Dutch","type":"game","website":"https://exospace-combat-engineer.com/"}